-- sleeper rewriting nfl_draft_year 2014 -> 2023 and weight 266 -> 310 in the same second on
-- 2025-09-09, so the row is natively the 2014 Arkansas player and the 2023 Notre Dame biography
-- is the overwrite. NULLing its identifier would discard the one field that is still its own.
